                <h2 class="u-custom-font u-font-montserrat u-text u-text-default u-text-1">About Us</h2>
                <div class="u-expanded-width u-tab-links-align-left u-tabs u-tabs-1">
                    <ul class="u-spacing-15 u-tab-list u-unstyled" role="tablist">
                        <li class="u-tab-item" role="presentation">
                            <a class="active u-active-palette-1-base u-button-style u-tab-link u-text-active-white u-text-body-color u-text-hover-grey-75 u-tab-link-1" id="link-tab-0da5" href="#tab-0da5" role="tab" aria-controls="tab-0da5" aria-selected="true">Overview</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="u-tab-item" role="presentation">
                            <a class="u-active-palette-1-base u-button-style u-tab-link u-text-active-white u-text-body-color u-text-hover-grey-75 u-tab-link-2" id="link-tab-14b7" href="#tab-14b7" role="tab" aria-controls="tab-14b7" aria-selected="false">Members</a>
                        </li>
                        <li class="u-tab-item" role="presentation">
                            <a class="u-active-palette-1-base u-button-style u-tab-link u-text-active-white u-text-body-color u-text-hover-grey-75 u-tab-link-3" id="link-tab-2917" href="#tab-2917" role="tab" aria-controls="tab-2917" aria-selected="false">Mission</a>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <div class="u-tab-content">
                        <div class="u-align-left u-container-style u-tab-active u-tab-pane u-white u-tab-pane-1" id="tab-0da5" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="link-tab-0da5">
                            <div class="u-container-layout u-valign-top u-container-layout-1">
                                <h5 class="u-custom-font u-font-montserrat u-text u-text-2">Welcome to our programming club! We are a group of high school students who are passionate about technology, programming, and innovation. Our club is dedicated to providing a platform for like-minded individuals to come together, learn from each other, and build a sense of community.</h5>
                                <p class="u-text u-text-palette-1-base u-text-3">Through a variety of activities, including attending tech events and conferences, connecting with alumni and industry professionals, participating in online communities, and collaborating on programming projects, we seek to expand our knowledge and understanding of the tech industry and provide opportunities for networking and career development.

                                  At our core, we value collaboration, creativity, and innovation. We believe that by working together and sharing our ideas, we can achieve our individual and collective goals and make a positive impact in our communities and the world. Our club is committed to providing an inclusive environment that encourages personal and professional growth, and celebrates the diversity of our members.
                                  
                                  Whether you're a seasoned programmer or just getting started, we welcome you to join us and be a part of our community. Together, we can unlock our potential and build a brighter future through programming.</p>
                                <p class="u-text u-text-4"></p>
